{"title":"2022 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The following graph shows the amount of money that each of four students donated to a school fundraiser.\n</p><p>(insert bar graph that goes up from 0 to 10: smaller tick marks = 1, large tick marks = 2, Haofei is 1 large tick mark up, Mike is 3 tick marks up, Pierre is 1 tick mark up, and Ritika is 4 tick marks up)\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>The total amount of money that they donated was\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/a/3dad1e4faa03cc31493036597a2c0d79c6aa7660.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ \\$20 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ \\$18 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ \\$16 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ \\$14 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ \\$22$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"479\" height=\"19\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>From the bar graph, we can see that Haofei donated <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/6/ee6e8cd66adab965db3a961cd262a4ba54e9a132.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />, Mike donated <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/1/d816ab274a3d9d6083e1fa5c6bc914c93ffc5acc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />, Pierre donated <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/6/ee6e8cd66adab965db3a961cd262a4ba54e9a132.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />, and Ritika donated <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/f/f7f9b76b8f6db99961a78ece506186b6bfb5eb00.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Thus, they donated <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/3/c63bd8c08c1cf16f429f53f880d33a985e17f235.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$2 + \\$6 + \\$2 + \\$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"141\" height=\"17\" /> in total. This simplifies to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/5/f859d2e6c1d2d340653a565fbe2eaa9a70c4492f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed {\\textbf {(B) } \\$18}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"75\" height=\"31\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Pascal\" title=\"2022 CEMC Pascal\">2022 CEMC Pascal</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Pascal_Problems\" title=\"2022 CEMC Pascal Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Pascal_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2022 CEMC Pascal Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"c